Hibiki maintains a narrow security and host-API overlay:

- bind only to 127.0.0.1;
- require a per-process Bearer token on every endpoint;
- expose capability, APK inspection, source image, and source-data endpoints;
- retain the upstream process identity and explicit /stop lifecycle.
